      },
      "description": "Time-series momentum across a fixed basket of US-listed global ETFs. Holds only what is trending in its own price, sizes what it holds by realised volatility, and goes to T-bills when nothing is. One monthly rebalance, or nothing.",
      "version": "0.1.1",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Atlas Trend US",
        "publisher": "aumos",
        "methodology": "Scores each ETF in a fixed multi-asset basket on an ensemble of 1, 3, 6 and 12-month total returns, holds only the positive ones at inverse-volatility weights under a portfolio volatility target, and puts everything else in short Treasuries. Returns one REBALANCE carrying the whole basket, or WAIT.",
        "assetClasses": [
          "etf",
          "cash"
        ],
        "markets": [
